# EKAP Multi-Layer Anomaly Detection System

> Dynamic endpoint-focused (aspx/ashx) hierarchical anomaly detection for EKAP IIS W3C logs.
> Batch training + near-real-time inference · No WAF/SIEM dependency · Segment-based thresholds

---

## Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph "DATA LAYER"
        A["IIS W3C Logs<br/>.log / .gz"] --> B["Parser<br/>Dynamic #Fields: mapping"]
        B --> C["Validator<br/>Quality checks"]
        C --> D["Dynamic Filter<br/>.aspx / .ashx only"]
    end

    subgraph "FEATURE LAYER"
        D --> E["Layer 0<br/>URL Normalize · UA Parse<br/>Segment ID · Missing Indicators"]
        E --> F["Layer 1 Features<br/>5-min Window Aggregation<br/>Counts · Rates · Latency · Burstiness"]
        E --> G["Layer 2 Features<br/>Request-Level<br/>IP Stats · Path Hash · Query Hash · Perf"]
        E --> H["Layer 3 Features<br/>Session Sequences<br/>Critical Endpoint Flows"]
    end

    subgraph "MODEL LAYER"
        F --> I["Layer 1 Model<br/>Rolling Median + MAD<br/>Robust Z-Score"]
        I -->|"window_is_hot"| J["Gating<br/>Hot Windows + Critical EPs"]
        J --> G
        G --> K["Layer 2 Model<br/>A: Segment IForest<br/>B: Denoising AE → Latent IF"]
        H --> L["Layer 3 Model<br/>Markov Transition Score"]
    end

    subgraph "SCORING LAYER"
        I --> M["Score Combiner<br/>Weighted Fusion"]
        K --> M
        L --> M
        M --> N["Segment Thresholds<br/>Quantile / EVT per Segment"]
        N --> O["Explain<br/>Reason Codes"]
        O --> P["Alert Producer<br/>Top-K Daily + Critical Quota"]
    end

    subgraph "OPS LAYER"
        P --> Q["Alerts<br/>JSONL + Parquet"]
        M --> R["Drift Monitor<br/>PSI · JSD · Score Shift"]
        R --> S["Retrain Trigger<br/>MLflow Registry"]
        M --> T["FastAPI<br/>/score · /health · /metrics"]
        T --> U["Prometheus"]
    end
```

## Quick Start

### Install
```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

### End-to-End Pipeline
```bash
# 1. Parse IIS logs
ekap-anom parse --input /path/to/logs/ --out data/parsed

# 2. Filter dynamic pages only
ekap-anom filter-dynamic --in data/parsed --out data/dynamic_only

# 3. Layer 1: Window features + scoring
ekap-anom featurize-layer1 --in data/dynamic_only --out data/features/layer1
ekap-anom infer-layer1 --in data/features/layer1 --out data/features/layer1

# 4. Layer 2: Request features + training
ekap-anom featurize-layer2 --in data/dynamic_only --layer1-dir data/features/layer1 --out data/features/layer2
ekap-anom train-layer2 --in data/features/layer2 --mode iforest --model-out models/layer2_iforest.pkl

# 5. Generate alerts
ekap-anom score --date 2024-04-22 --out data/alerts

# 6. Serve API
ekap-anom serve --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
```

### Docker
```bash
cd docker
docker-compose up -d
```

### Run Tests
```bash
pytest tests/ -v
```

## Project Structure

```
repo/
├── pyproject.toml                 # Project config, dependencies, CLI entry
├── README.md
├── configs/
│   ├── default.yaml               # All tunable parameters
│   └── prod.yaml                  # Production overrides
├── src/ekap_anom/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── cli.py                     # Click CLI (parse, filter, featurize, train, infer, score, serve)
│   ├── config.py                  # Pydantic Settings (YAML + env vars)
│   ├── logging.py                 # Structured JSON logging (structlog)
│   ├── utils/
│   │   ├── hashing.py             # MurmurHash feature hashing (fixed-dim vectors)
│   │   ├── time.py                # UTC parse, window bucketing
│   │   ├── url.py                 # URL normalize, path template, query parse
│   │   ├── ua.py                  # User-Agent parse, bot detection, novelty
│   │   └── segment.py             # Segment ID generation
│   ├── ingest/
│   │   ├── reader.py              # Streaming line reader (.log/.gz)
│   │   ├── parser.py              # W3C parser (dynamic #Fields:, chunked Parquet out)
│   │   ├── schema.py              # IIS field types, aliases, coercion
│   │   └── validators.py          # Required columns, status range, time_taken
│   ├── filters/
│   │   └── dynamic_only.py        # Keep only .aspx/.ashx
│   ├── features/
│   │   ├── layer1_agg.py          # 5-min window aggregation (counts, rates, latency, burstiness)
│   │   ├── layer2_req.py          # Request-level (IP, UA, path/query hash, perf, status)
│   │   ├── layer3_session.py      # Sessionization + sequence extraction
│   │   └── joins.py               # Layer1 → Layer2 score join + hot-window gating
│   ├── models/
│   │   ├── layer1_baseline.py     # Rolling median + MAD robust z-score
│   │   ├── layer2_iforest.py      # Per-segment Isolation Forest (parent/global fallback)
│   │   ├── layer2_autoencoder.py  # Denoising AE → latent IF (Phase 2)
│   │   ├── layer3_markov.py       # Markov rare-transition scorer
│   │   ├── layer3_seqae.py        # Seq2Seq AE placeholder (Phase 3)
│   │   └── registry.py            # MLflow model save/load/promote
│   ├── scoring/
│   │   ├── combine.py             # Weighted score fusion
│   │   ├── threshold.py           # Segment-based quantile + EVT/POT
│   │   ├── explain.py             # Reason code generation
│   │   └── alerts.py              # Top-K alerts + critical endpoint quota
│   ├── monitoring/
│   │   ├── drift.py               # PSI, JSD, score shift, drift report
│   │   └── metrics.py             # Prometheus counters/histograms/gauges
│   └── api/
│       ├── app.py                 # FastAPI (/score, /health, /metrics)
│       └── schemas.py             # Pydantic request/response models
├── tests/
│   ├── test_parser.py
│   ├── test_dynamic_filter.py
│   ├── test_endpoint_group.py
│   ├── test_layer1_agg.py
